  "cited_article_id": "configure-roles-and-permissions",
  "reply": "To create a custom security role, go to **Settings > Practice Staff > Roles & Permissions**. Click **Create New Role** (or pick an existing role) and use the toggles to enable or disable access to categories such as *Billing*, *Patient Charts*, and *System Settings* as needed. After setting the permissions, click **Assign Users**, select the staff members who should have this role, and press **Save Changes**. Remember that every active user must be assigned to at least one role, and you cannot set individual overrides outside the role. If a user still can’t see a menu, confirm their account is active and have them clear their browser cache before logging in again."
}
